sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant C as Client
  participant F as Follower node
  participant L as Leader node
  participant P as Other replicas
  participant S as SQL engine + store (each node)
  C->>F: POST /transaction {statements, statement_params}
  F->>F: leader known? (wait up to 5 s)
  F->>L: forward request
  L->>L: Bind(?) parameters -> one Raft log entry
  L->>P: AppendEntries over TCP
  P-->>L: ack once written to BoltDB log
  L->>L: majority reached -> committed
  L->>S: FSM apply: run batch, roll back all on any error
  P->>S: FSM apply in the same log order
  L-->>F: 200 {"message":"transaction committed"}
  F-->>C: 200 {"message":"transaction committed"}
